{%- comment -%}
  AJ Tomorrow's Yoink — the sneak peek, as its own block.

  SPLIT OUT OF aj-deal-urgency BECAUSE THE TWO HAVE OPPOSITE JOBS. The countdown
  and the claimed bar argue FOR buying now and belong beside the price, above
  the button. This block argues that there is another chance tomorrow, and must
  sit below the button or it undercuts the very thing the countdown is doing.
  While they shared one block the product page could only ever have one of them
  in the right place.

  Renders ONLY when the product being viewed is the deal running right now — the
  same gate the urgency block uses, because "Today's Yoink not your thing?"
  makes no sense on a page that is not today's Yoink.

  Resolution is duplicated from sections/aj-daily-deal.liquid and
  blocks/aj-deal-urgency.liquid rather than shared, because `render` gives a
  snippet its own scope and cannot hand variables back. Keep the three in step.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign this_product = closest.product
  assign now = 'now' | date: '%s' | plus: 0
  assign is_live_deal = false

  for entry in shop.metaobjects.daily_deal.values
    assign starts = entry.starts_at.value | date: '%s' | plus: 0
    assign ends = entry.ends_at.value | date: '%s' | plus: 0
    if starts <= now and ends > now
      if entry.product.value.id == this_product.id
        assign is_live_deal = true
      endif
      break
    endif
  endfor
-%}

{%- if is_live_deal and settings.tomorrow_enabled -%}
  <div
    class="aj-pdp-tomorrow spacing-style"
    style="{% render 'spacing-style', settings: block.settings %}"
    {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
  >
    {% render 'aj-deal-tomorrow',
      heading: settings.tomorrow_heading,
      show_signup: settings.tomorrow_signup
    %}
  </div>
{%- endif -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "AJ Tomorrow's Yoink",
  "tag": null,
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "A sneak peek at the next Yoink, for the shopper who has decided against this one. PLACE IT BELOW THE BUY BUTTONS — above them it argues against buying at the moment of highest intent. Shows only on the product that is the live deal, and only when a next deal is queued. Wording is in Theme settings → Deal urgency."
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding-block-start",
      "label": "Top",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 0
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding-block-end",
      "label": "Bottom",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 0
    }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "AJ Tomorrow's Yoink" }]
}
{% endschema %}
